/*
  HttpStatusTool.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0016 · HttpStatusTool (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `HttpStatusTool` resolves (table "HttpStatusTool") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first block is the exact set of titles/labels extracted from the web source
  (features/admin/components/devtools/tools/HttpStatusTool.tsx). Those keys are
  natural-language phrases that are absent from web `en.json`, so i18next renders
  them verbatim; the values here reproduce that exactly. The remainder backs the
  HTTP-class words (for VoiceOver), pagination, freshness chip, native states,
  and accessibility.
*/

